## Error Handling Matrix

| Error Type | Retry? | Fallback | Log Level |
|------------|--------|----------|-----------|
| `TimeoutError` | Yes (3x) | Rule-based | WARNING |
| `ConnectionError` | Yes (3x) | Rule-based | WARNING |
| `TokenLimitExceeded` | No | Truncate + retry | ERROR |
| `InvalidResponse` | No | Rule-based | ERROR |
| `ModelNotFound` | No | Raise exception | CRITICAL |

## Performance Requirements

- **Response Time**: < 2 seconds for narrative generation
- **Timeout**: 5 seconds max before fallback
- **Cache Hit Rate**: > 30% for common scenarios
- **Fallback Rate**: < 10% in normal operation
- **No Blocking**: All AI calls must be async

