## Anti-Patterns to Prevent

❌ **Synchronous AI Calls**: Never use `requests.post()` in game loop
❌ **Unconstrained Prompts**: Always enforce 4096 token limit
❌ **No Fallbacks**: Every AI call must have rule-based fallback
❌ **Blocking on Failures**: Never hang game waiting for AI
❌ **Uncached Responses**: Cache identical requests
❌ **Unvalidated JSON**: Always use Pydantic or similar for validation

## Success Metrics

- AI enhances narrative without blocking gameplay
- Fallbacks are seamless to player experience
- < 5 second response time for all AI features
- Cache hit rate > 30%
